1. What this crate ships
------------------------
Unlike `lovyangfx-fonts` (which deliberately ships no font data), THIS crate
bundles 20 pre-extracted glyph blobs under `fonts/`: eFont CN, sizes
10/12/14/16/24 px, each in regular/bold/italic/bold-italic. They were
extracted with `lgyf-gen` (from lovyangfx-fonts) out of LovyanGFX'
`src/lgfx/Fonts/efont/lgfx_efont_cn.c`. Extraction is length-checked against
the upstream array declarations and every blob is regression-tested
(golden byte sizes + a ~23.9k-codepoint decode sweep) in this crate's test
suite; `fonts/SHA256SUMS` pins the shipped bytes.

